Reference data in this directory
==================================

The CSV files in tests/reference/ are a validation extract of the author's
prior Sentinel-2 classification series for Endho Reservoir:

- serie_2017-01-01_2026-12-31_v2026-10-22.csv — 465 scenes, 2017-2026,
  raw classifier output (no exposed-bed correction).
- gate_scenes.csv — the fixed 30-scene identity-gate sample drawn from it.

